// A JPEG of at most 2 MiB and 2,048 px a side (the panel sends at most 1,600 px). The server reads the dimensions before decoding and encodes the pixels again, so no metadata (EXIF, location) is kept. The photo waits until a question names it in `attachmentIds`; it then goes to the model with that question only and is deleted with the chat. Photos never sent are deleted after a day; at most 6 wait in one chat. `422` for anything else.
